THIRD-PARTY NOTICES — firestore_kit

firestore_kit is an independent, pure-Dart implementation of the Cloud
Firestore client API. It mirrors the public API of FlutterFire's
`cloud_firestore` package (method names, signatures and documented behaviour)
so that migration diffs are minimal, but it does not include FlutterFire
source code.

