Google APIs protocol buffer definitions
https://github.com/googleapis/googleapis

The Dart classes under lib/src/grpc/generated/ are generated with protoc and
protoc_plugin from the following .proto files, which are distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0:

  google/firestore/v1/*.proto
  google/rpc/status.proto
  google/type/latlng.proto

